Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Second Episode\NA New King
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be capable of doing it,\Nif I really wanted to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Until now I have been\Nso lacking in initiative and lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have decided\Nthat I have courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Uranaru, today I have decided:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I will proclaim things that\Ntomorrow everyone will be surprised by!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, wait anxiously\Nfor tomorrow to arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, would you please tell me,\Nwhat you intend to proclaim?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot, it is a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Uranaru, leave me alone.\NGo away, quickly! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to change\Nthat old law of Silverland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that forbids a woman\Nfrom becoming King...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and ruling the country.\NIt was about time to put an end...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...to these stupid\Ndiscriminations, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There, it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, I want to change all\Nthe bad laws into good laws!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's happening?!\NWhat are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince! Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, this is a good one!\NThe King is nowhere to be found!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- He can't be found!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't been seen anywhere\Nsince this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Mother?\NHow are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They are desperately searching for the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- But where is the King?!\N- Where is the King?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Search for him again!\NOn every floor! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your Majesty!\N- Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, we have searched for him\Nin every corner of the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- But we didn't find him!\N- Inspect the moat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the King\Nremained writing something...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...for a long time, alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If something bad\Nwere to happen to him..!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.94,0:05:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look for him again, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine you are\Nvery worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it is very strange that the King\Ndisappeared like this, all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't that right?\N- Don't say useless things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look for\Nhim too, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, where are you? Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That armor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he be in the tomb of the\Nancestors? But that's impossible...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!\NIt must have been an illusion...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.14,0:06:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a man who claims\Nto have seen the King...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...early this morning!\N- What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- In the northern part of the valley.\N- Alright, I'm going to check!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, go to the northern valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal! What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That shoe looks like my father's!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, hold the end\Nof this rope in your mouth! I'm going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dad's shoe!\NJust as I thought...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.34,0:08:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Why did you die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, since the King is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the Prince will ascend the throne\Nin a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The new King! King Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If our plan goes well\Nuntil that moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be very interesting\Nto wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you laughing at, idiot?!\N- But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire, it's me.\N- Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You are beautiful, Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I came to comfort you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I won't cry anymore.\NInstead, I was getting dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is that, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last time\Nthat I can dress like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- If I become King,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to wear\Na dress like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then wear it as if it were\Nthe last. - All right, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.58,0:10:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nurse, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.30,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!\NI was helping her get dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nurse, please don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now give me a smile!\N- How can I not cry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, this won't be\Nthe last time you dress like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.22,0:11:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- When you become King,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you can modify the law\Nand make a new one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so that everyone, even women,\Ncan become King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! I'll be able to be King\Neven though I'm a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The coronation ceremony\Nwill take place tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The preparations are almost complete
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A large delegation has arrived\Nfrom all parts of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Prince Sapphire\Nhas settled down...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.18,0:13:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...and is waiting for dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,God, please give me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of becoming King! I fear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the sun will rise.\NGod, please protect me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharmacist, haven't you\Nmade that medicine yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost finished. In\Nthree hours it will be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up or we won't make it in\Ntime for the coronation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make it in time, we'll make it\Nin time for the coronation ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- But does it really work?\N- All it takes is for someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...to take just a little of it\Nto say everything they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.78,0:14:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't make it in time,\Nyou will die! Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will wait here\Nuntil you have finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.02,0:14:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How violent you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten very thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Drink a little from that flask.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But what did you make me drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down,\Nthere's nothing to worry about!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm swelling up!\NI'm going to burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't fear!\NNow I will give you a good remedy right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, but hurry!\N- Here, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- You cursed wretch!\N- Now stay calm and rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me work in peace\Nuntil I am finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the coronation ceremony begin..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,..of Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the grand coronation ceremony begins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, many representatives are gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...who have come from all parts of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They are waiting for the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When Prince Sapphire sits on the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he will be the new King of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\NSoon there will be the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot..! And stop it!\NHere, I'll give you this sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, the ceremony will go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- But where is Nylon?\N- He hasn't arrived yet, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Archbishop\Nis arriving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And here comes\NPrince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the coronation ceremony\Nbegin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three... My God!\NThere are a hundred diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No! No! I say that there\Nare at least two hundred of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bravo!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Grand Duke, Nylon is back!\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to put that\Nmedicine in the Queen's wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke has ordered to\Nput the medicine in the Queen's wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, quick, give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?! No! I won't give it to you!\N- Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought it and I\Nwant to put it in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the Queen's wine!\NDamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you must rest!\NI told you I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you that\NI will do it! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- You must rest! Understood?\N- I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.22,0:19:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, let the toast begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, pour wine\Ninto your glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin,\Nplease, start the toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment! Is\Nthis the Queen's glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir.\N- Ah, excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And now let us toast to the\Nhealth of King Sapphire of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cheers!\N- Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live our King!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin\Nlooks strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone escort the\NQueen to her room!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, dear! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I didn't know it\Nwas so bitter to hide the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Now everyone pay attention...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,... and listen to me, because\NI will tell you everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening, Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is my daughter!\NSapphire is a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sapphire is a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To make her King,\Nwe deceived you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we publicly\Npassed her off as a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You all heard! You\Nare all witnesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This mother and her\Ndaughter have lied...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...and have deceived\Nthe people for 13 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.74,0:21:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They are cowards who\Nhave deceived good people!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! Did I say something?\N- Mother, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true: it's too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You have confessed\Neverything! Soldiers, arrest them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.70,0:22:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And also arrest their\Nthree accomplices!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As punishment, I order\Nthem to be locked up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the coffin\Ntower until they die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is there anyone who opposes?\N- The coffin tower?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And their three accomplices,\Nas punishment for helping them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.46,0:22:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- will be slaves!\N- Slaves?! - Slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing:\NI have decided that my son Plastic
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...will become the new King!\N- What? Plastic the new King?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not possible! He's an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic will be the King!\NIs there anyone who wants to oppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.86,0:22:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And now take away\Nthose vile traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.22,0:23:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire and Queen,\Nit is unpleasant, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.46,0:23:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but please get into\Nthe prisoners' carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.74,0:23:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, please, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.58,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been trapped\Nby Duralumin, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you drank\Nsome drugged wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.78,0:23:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never see you again, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then farewell! Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Coffin Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.34,0:24:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, Queen,\NI am sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but once\Nyou are locked in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.86,0:24:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never be able to get out of it again.\NPrepare yourselves.
